---

<section id="services">
  <!-- Tile 1: Full-bleed Light Tile (Pure White) -->
  <div class="product-tile product-tile-light">
    <div class="tile-container">
      <span class="eyebrow">HIGH-TICKET US SERVICES</span>
      <h2 class="display-lg">SEO Ustaad USA Service Portfolio</h2>
      <p class="lead-text">Custom Web Engineering, Scroll Canvas Physics, and AI Search Optimization tailored for US startups, enterprise leaders, and creative agencies.</p>
      
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrap">🎬</div>
          <h3>Scroll-Trigger Canvas Physics</h3>
          <p>60fps frame-scrubbed interactive canvas web experiences built with GSAP 3, Lenis, and custom WebGL shaders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrap">🤖</div>
          <h3>AEO & GEO AI Optimization</h3>
          <p>Entity-based structured data (JSON-LD) designed for direct answer extraction in ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrap">⚡</div>
          <h3>Sub-Second Core Web Vitals</h3>
          <p>100/100 Google Lighthouse speed guarantee with zero Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) and sub-0.8s LCP across US CDNs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="tile-actions">
        <a href="#booking-modal" class="button-primary">Request US Custom Proposal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tile 2: Full-bleed Dark Tile (Void Black / Apple Tile 1) -->
  <div class="product-tile product-tile-dark" id="performance">
    <div class="tile-container">
      <span class="eyebrow dark">GUARANTEED LIGHTHOUSE AUDIT METRICS</span>
      <h2 class="display-lg">100 / 100 Performance Scorecard</h2>
      <p class="lead-text light">SEO Ustaad USA guarantees zero performance degradation when adding interactive 3D and scroll motion physics.</p>

      <div class="vitals-dashboard">
        <div class="metric-box">
          <span class="metric-value green">100</span>
          <span class="metric-label">Performance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-box">
          <span class="metric-value green">100</span>
          <span class="metric-label">Accessibility</span>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-box">
          <span class="metric-value green">100</span>
          <span class="metric-label">Best Practices</span>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-box">
          <span class="metric-value green">100</span>
          <span class="metric-label">SEO / AEO</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tile 3: Full-bleed Parchment Tile (Apple Off-White #f5f5f7) -->
  <div class="product-tile product-tile-parchment" id="us-advantage">
    <div class="tile-container">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE SEO USTAAD USA ADVANTAGE</span>
      <h2 class="display-lg">Built for US Market Leadership</h2>
      <p class="lead-text">Dedicated time-zone alignment, transparent pricing, and rapid sprint execution for US enterprise clients.</p>

      <div class="advantage-list">
        <div class="advantage-item">
          <span class="badge">EST & PST</span>
          <div>
            <h4>US Business Hours Synchronized</h4>
            <p>Direct communication via Slack, Teams, and Google Meet during standard US business hours (EST, CST, PST).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="advantage-item">
          <span class="badge">2-WEEK SPRINT</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Rapid 14-Day Delivery Sprint</h4>
            <p>From initial design alignment to production deployment in as little as 14 business days.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="advantage-item">
          <span class="badge">100% CODE OWNERSHIP</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Complete IP & Code Ownership</h4>
            <p>You retain 100% full ownership of your source code, IP rights, git repositories, and deployment pipelines.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .eyebrow.dark {
    color: var(--color-primary-on-dark);
  }

  .lead-text.light {
    color: var(--color-body-muted);
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 48px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-pearl);
    padding: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
  }

  .icon-wrap {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted-80);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .vitals-dashboard {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .metric-box {
    background: var(--color-surface-tile-2);
    padding: 24px 36px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    min-width: 160px;
  }

  .metric-value {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    display: block;
  }

  .metric-value.green {
    color: #30d158;
  }

  .metric-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-body-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .advantage-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .advantage-item {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .badge {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .advantage-item h4 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .advantage-item p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted-80);
  }

  .tile-actions {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
</style>
